{
  "name": "Buying only moves your hand for a first primary: knife in hand, a pistol, armor, a helmet, a grenade, the drink and pistol ammo leave it on the knife; the first rifle goes to hand; pistol in hand, a rifle that replaces the rifle and a pistol that replaces the pistol leave it on the pistol (buy <item> in the console)",
